Adds deterministic governance decision to dispatchRun():

Pre-run gate (before any step):
- Validates adapter.governance.system_state_updates.mode === "hybrid"
- Validates require_manual_approval_for includes "trust_change"
- Validates auto_apply_for includes "trivial"
- Fails with ADAPTER_GOVERNANCE_MISCONFIGURED (no steps execute)

Per-step governance (ordering locked per §8):
- §8.8: TRUST_CHANGE_MISSING_NOTES before writeStepReport
- §8.9: STEP_REPORT_INVALID defensive assert for unknown state_impact
- §8.12-13: governanceDecision() evaluated after writeStepReport;
  require_manual_approval halts with DISPATCH_HALTED_GOVERNANCE

New exports: governanceDecision() (pure function, no side effects)
New error codes: ADAPTER_GOVERNANCE_MISCONFIGURED, STEP_REPORT_INVALID,
  TRUST_CHANGE_MISSING_NOTES, DISPATCH_HALTED_GOVERNANCE

Tests: 47 pass (21 Slice 1/2 + 11 Slice 3 + 15 Slice 4), 0 fail.
No StepReport schema changes. No adapter schema changes. No run states.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
